data: {"type":"response.function_call_arguments.done","arguments":"{\"content\":\"At dawn, the quiet windows bloom with gold,\\nAnd rooftops catch the first ascending flame;\\nThe sleeping streets release the night they hold,\\nWhile sparrows stitch the morning into name.\\n\\nA river carries clouds beneath its skin,\\nIts silver language folding through the reeds;\\nThe willows lean to hear the world begin,\\nAnd dew collects like letters on the weeds.\\n\\nI walk where yesterday has left no trace,\\nExcept a footprint dark with vanished rain;\\nThe breeze unbuttons every guarded place,\\nThen fills my empty pockets up again.\\n\\nBeyond the hill, the fields are turning green,\\nA patient choir of stems beneath the sun;\\nThe soil remembers every buried dream,\\nAnd gives them back as roots, one by one.\\n\\nA child lets loose a scarlet paper kite,\\nWhich climbs, a small rebellion, through the blue;\\nIts thread, a trembling line of human sight,\\nConnects the earth to all we cannot view.\\n\\nBy noon, the market rings with jars and bells,\\nWith citrus, bread, and voices bright as brass;\\nThe day is made of countless little spells,\\nEach ordinary wonder letting pass.\\n\\nToward evening, shadows lengthen at my feet,\\nAnd swallows write their signatures in air;\\nThe sun descends, but leaves the stones still sweet,\\nAs if its warmth has promised to remain there.\\n\\nNight gathers slowly, velvet afterglow,\\nAnd stars appear like windows newly lit;\\nI learn again what all the quiet know:\\nThe dark is not an ending, but a door.\\n\\nSo let me enter softly, unafraid,\\nWith open hands and no demand for proof;\\nThe moon will silver every choice I made,\\nAnd dreams will raise their lanterns through the roof.\\n\\nTomorrow waits beyond the sleeping trees,\\nA blank white page, a road the heart can choose;\\nI rest beneath the vast and listening breeze,\\nWhile dawn prepares its bright and patient news.\"}","item_id":"fc_06651145d189e8bb016ad5eea6bd9c87d0a54ec565414e92f9","output_index":0,"sequence_number":430}

